Slovak Railways Redesign is published in three parts.
This is an independent student project by Dalibor Itze. It is not an
official work of Železničná spoločnosť Slovensko. Names such as ZSSK,
Stadler, Siemens, and the railway's existing marks remain their owners'
trademarks.

