## Original design assets — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0

Original models, livery renders, diagrams, and graphics made for this thesis
are licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Copyright 2025 Dalibor Itze

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercial
use, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the license, and indicate
if you made changes.

This covers, in particular:

- `models/` — the 3D rolling-stock modules used by the train builder
- `assets/` — builder thumbnails, logo, and interface drawings
- `public/other/renders/` — the livery renders
- original diagrams and pictograms drawn for the thesis

The SIL Open Font License applies only to font software. These images and
models are therefore released under CC BY 4.0, which is the open licence
that actually covers them.

## Not included in the open grant

The following stay under their own licences and are not relicensed by this
file:

- Reference photographs in `public/other/` (archive photos, ÖBB, Siemens, and
  similar research images). See `public/content_sources.html`.
- Environment maps (`*.hdr`, `*.exr`), which are third-party lighting assets.
- Instrument Sans and Instrument Serif, loaded from Google Fonts and already
  under the SIL Open Font License. They are not vendored in this repository.
- Trademarks of Železničná spoločnosť Slovensko and of rolling-stock
  manufacturers.
